---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import { SITE, AFFILIATION_LINE } from '../lib/site';
---
<Base title="About Sharjeel Hashmat" description="UAE property consultant — background, philosophy and how I work.">
  <section class="section">
    <div class="narrow">
      <p class="eyebrow">About</p>
      <h1>{SITE.name}</h1>
      <p class="kicker" style="margin-top:.5rem">{SITE.title} · UAE</p>

      <div style="margin-top:2rem">
        <p>I work with buyers, investors, sellers and international clients across the UAE — on ready properties, off-plan launches, and the secondary market.</p>
        <p>In UAE real estate since 2018, with a decade across banking sales and senior management behind me. I hold a Bachelor of Commerce from the University of Karachi.</p>
        <p>I speak English, Urdu and Arabic, which covers most of the conversations that actually happen in this market.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="margin-top:2.5rem">
        <h2>How I work</h2>
        <p>I work for you — not a developer, not a sales target. If a listing isn't right for you, I'll say so, even if it costs me the deal. Every recommendation goes through the same five checks: price, returns, risk, exit, and my view. <a href="/investment-approach">The approach in full.</a></p>
      </div>

      <div class="card" style="margin-top:1.5rem">
        <p class="kicker" style="margin:0">Track record</p>
        <p class="small">Selected transactions and client outcomes will be added here as engagements complete and clients agree to be featured — this section isn't populated with placeholder claims.</p>
      </div>

      {AFFILIATION_LINE && <p class="fine" style="margin-top:2.5rem">{AFFILIATION_LINE}</p>}
      <div class="actions"><a class="btn" href="/contact">Get in touch</a></div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Base>
